 "description": "1RU coax host switch, the high-power twelve-port model - twelve ReadyLink ports on F connectors that carry ReadyLink data and PoE over a building's existing coax and passive splitters, up to sixteen clients per port, two 10G SFP+ and two GbE RJ45 uplinks, a pair of BNC sync jacks, and a console, USB-C and reset on the fixed left panel. The twelve F-type ports are a line card in the upper of two line-card slots; the lower slot ships blanked. Two internal 300 W supplies behind two switched C14 inlets give a 520 W PoE budget on dual power, and two six-pole DC headers at the rear stack DC power between units. It is the GL-12xC-240D with the larger PoE budget.",
 "format": 1,
